senses.gloss:
रच् रचयति pp. रचित (q.v.) produce, form, make (also
w. 2 acc.);
 contrive, arrange, prepare;
 cause, effect;
 compose, write;
place or fix on or in (loc.). —आ arrange, prepare;
 write, compose;
put on, furnish with (instr.). उप produce, make, form, cause, effect.
वि produce, fabricate, construct, cause, effect, arrange, prepare;
compose, write;
 invent, find out;
 put, place, fix on or in (loc.);
furnish with (instr.).

रचन n. arranging, managing, preparing, writing,
composing;
 f. आ arrangement, disposition, preparation, contrivance,
bringing about, putting in or on, finding out, invention, fiction;
style, literary composition.
